## Common Error Types and Resolutions

| Error Type | Symptoms | Resolution Approach |
|------------|----------|---------------------|
| Null Reference | "Cannot read property of undefined" | Add null guards and default values |
| Type Mismatch | "TypeError: X is not a function" | Add type checking and validation |
| React Key Errors | "Warning: Each child in a list should have a unique key" | Implement proper key generation |
| Effect Dependency | Infinite render loops | Fix dependency arrays in useEffect hooks |
| API Error Handling | Unhandled API errors | Implement try/catch and error states |
| State Update on Unmounted | "Can't perform a React state update on unmounted component" | Add mounted checks or use AbortController |
| Promise Rejections | "Unhandled promise rejection" | Add proper catch handlers to promises |
| CSS/Style Errors | Visual UI glitches | Fix CSS specificity issues or add scoped styles |

## Recovery Strategies by Error Category

### Critical Runtime Errors
- Implement immediate null checking
- Add fallback component rendering
- Create recovery restart mechanisms
- Enhance error logging for diagnostics
- Add retry logic for transient issues

### State Management Recovery
- Implement reducer pattern for complex state
- Add immutable update patterns
- Use advanced selector patterns
- Implement state persistence for recovery
- Add state validation before updates

### API Integration Recovery
- Implement retrying with exponential backoff
- Add request cancellation on component unmount
- Create offline fallback mechanisms
- Implement optimistic updates with rollback
- Add data validation before state updates

